{
  "name": "edge-face-sentinel",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "main": "index.js",
  "comment": "Expo SDK 53 (RN 0.79 / React 19) dev-build. Minimal deps: Expo built-ins replace sqlite/fs/encrypted-storage/netinfo/uuid/get-random-values, and a tiny useState router replaces @react-navigation. Custom face-warp ships as the local Expo module in modules/face-processor. Run `npx expo install --fix` once after install to normalize patch versions to the SDK. See docs/INTEGRATION.md.",
